# Implementation Plan: CI/CD Pipeline (CRM-005)

## Goal
Implement a robust CI/CD pipeline to ensure code quality and safe promotion from Staging to Production.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> You must manually configure **Branch Protection Rules** in GitHub for `master` after this task is complete to strictly enforce the pipeline. I will provide instructions.

## Proposed Changes

### [GitHub Actions]
#### [NEW] [.github/workflows/ci.yml](file:///c:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/.github/workflows/ci.yml)
- Creates a workflow that runs on:
    - Push to `staging`
    - Pull Request to `master`
- Executes: `npm run test:smoke` (Type Checking)

## Verification Plan

### Automated
- Push the new workflow to `staging`.
- Verify the Action runs in the "Actions" tab of the GitHub repository.
- Verify it passes (green check).

### Manual
- Simulate a PR from `staging` to `master` (optional) to see the check status.
